repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/johannes-balkenhol/PANC_3D-tissue_scAnalysis
abstract: >-
  Single-cell RNA-seq analysis pipeline for a 3D PANC-1 pancreatic tumour
  tissue model: QC, clustering, pseudotime trajectories, trajectory-coupled
  dynamic PPI network topology, identification of the CDK1-CDKN1A-WEE1
  chemoresistance bottleneck, and validation in a PDAC patient atlas.
keywords:
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma
  - 3D tissue model
  - gemcitabine resistance
  - network topology
  - pseudotime
